      <data key="d2">ramdocs-0341-0296b4a3f7dd</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;AUSTRIA&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Austria is mentioned as the location where some princes are also archdukes, indicating a connection to the Habsburg dynasty."</data>
      <data key="d2">ramdocs-0341-0296b4a3f7dd</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;GRAND DUKES OF TUSCANY&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The Grand dukes of Tuscany refer to the ruling family of the Duchy of Tuscany, a historical Italian state."</data>
      <data key="d2">ramdocs-0341-0296b4a3f7dd</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;DUCHY OF TUSCANY&quot;">
